adius += dt * (p.type === 'mist' ? 8 : p.type === 'fog' ? 5 : 15);\n      p.life -= dt;\n      p.alpha = Math.max(0, (p.life / p.maxLife) * (p.type === 'spark' ? 0.6 : 0.3));\n    });\n    this.particles = this.particles.filter((p) => p.life > 0);\n\n    this.fogLayers.forEach((f) => {\n      f.x += Math.sin(this.time * f.speed + f.phase) * 0.0003;\n      f.y += Math.cos(this.time * f.speed * 0.7 + f.phase) * 0.0002;\n      if (f.x < -0.3) f.x = 1.3;\n      if (f.x > 1.3) f.x = -0.3;\n    });\n\n    // Ambient particle spawning\n    if (Math.random() < dt * 0.5) {\n      const w = this.renderer.w;\n      const h = this.renderer.h;\n      this.spawnAmbientParticle(Math.random() * w, h + 20);\n    }\n  }\n\n  spawnBurst(cx: number, cy: number, count = 12) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) {\n      const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;\n      const speed = 20 + Math.random() * 60;\n      this.particles.push({\n        x: cx, y: cy,\n        radius: 5 + Math.random() * 15,\n        alpha: 0.2 + Math.random() * 0.15,\n        vx: Math.cos(angle) * speed,\n        vy: Math.sin(angle) * speed,\n        life: 1 + Math.random() * 2,\n        maxLife: 1 + Math.random() * 2,\n        type: 'ink',\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  private spawnAmbientParticle(x: number, y: number) {\n    this.particles.push({\n      x, y,\n      radius: 3 + Math.random() * 8,\n      alpha: 0.1,\n      vx: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10,\n      vy: -5 - Math.random() * 15,\n      life: 3 + Math.random() * 4,\n      maxLife: 3 + Math.random() * 4,\n      type: 'mist',\n    });\n  }\n\n  renderFog() {\n    const ctx = this.renderer.context;\n    const w = this.renderer.w;\n    const h = this.renderer.h;\n\n    const presetColors: Record<string, string> = {\n      default: 'rgba(30, 25, 20, ',\n      horror: 'rgba(40, 10, 15, ',\n      underground: 'rgba(10, 15, 25, ',\n      temple: 'rgba(25, 20, 10, ',\n      court: 'rgba(30, 15, 10, ',\n      night: 'rgba(10, 15, 25, ',\n    };\n    const colorBase = presetColors[this.atmospherePreset] ?? presetColors['default'];\n\n    this.fogLayers.forEach((f) => {\n      const cx = f.x * w;\n      const cy = f.y * h;\n      const r = Math.max(1, f.radius * Math.max(w, h));\n\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.globalAlpha = f.alpha * (0.7 + Math.sin(this.time * 0.5 + f.phase) * 0.3);\n      const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, 0, cx, cy, r);\n      grad.addColorStop(0, colorBase + '0.15)');\n      grad.addColorStop(0.5, colorBase + '0.06)');\n      grad.addColorStop(1, 'transparent');\n      ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n      ctx.fillRect(cx - r, cy - r, r * 2, r * 2);\n      ctx.restore();\n    });\n  }\n\n  renderCandleGlow(x: number, y: number, radius: number, intensity = 0.5) {\n    const ctx = this.renderer.context;\n    const flicker = Math.sin(this.time * 8) * 0.05 + Math.sin(this.time * 13) * 0.03;\n    const r = Math.max(1, radius);\n\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = intensity + flicker;\n    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(x, y, 0, x, y, r);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(255, 200, 100, 0.2)');\n    grad.addColorStop(0.3, 'rgba(255, 150, 50, 0.08)');\n    grad.addColorStop(1, 'transparent');\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    ctx.fillRect(x - r, y - r, r * 2, r * 2);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  renderTransition(progress: number) {\n    const ctx = this.renderer.context;\n    const w = this.renderer.w;\n    const h = this.renderer.h;\n\n    if (progress < 0.5) {\n      const p = progress * 2;\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.globalAlpha = p;\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#050508';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n\n      this.renderInkSpread(ctx, w / 2, h / 2, p * Math.max(w, h) * 0.6);\n      ctx.restore();\n    } else {\n      const p = (progress - 0.5) * 2;\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.globalAlpha = 1 - p;\n      ctx.fillStyle = '#050508';\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n      ctx.restore();\n    }\n\n    this.renderParticles(ctx);\n  }\n\n  renderInkFilter(alpha: number) {\n    const ctx = this.renderer.context;\n    const w = this.renderer.w;\n    const h = this.renderer.h;\n    ctx.save();\n    ctx.globalAlpha = alpha;\n\n    const step = 16;\n    const imageData = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, w * (window.devicePixelRatio || 1), h * (window.devicePixelRatio || 1));\n    const data = imageData.data;\n    for (let i = 0; i < data.length; i += step * 4) {\n      const avg = (data[i] + data[i + 1] + data[i + 2]) / 3;\n      const ink = avg > 128 ? 255 : avg * 1.5;\n      data[i] = ink * 0.9;\n      data[i + 1] = ink * 0.85;\n      data[i + 2] = ink * 0.8;\n    }\n    ctx.putImageData(imageData, 0, 0);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  renderVignette(intensity = 0.4) {\n    const ctx = this.renderer.context;\n    const w = this.renderer.w;\n    const h = this.renderer.h;\n\n    ctx.save();\n    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(w / 2, h / 2, w * 0.25, w / 2, h / 2, w * 0.75);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, 'transparent');\n    grad.addColorStop(1, `rgba(5, 5, 8, ${intensity})`);\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, w, h);\n    ctx.restore();\n  }\n\n  private renderInkSpread(ctx: CanvasRenderingContext2D, cx: number, cy: number, radius: number) {\n    const r = Math.max(1, radius);\n    const grad = ctx.createRadialGradient(cx, cy, 0, cx, cy, r);\n    grad.addColorStop(0, 'rgba(5, 5, 8, 0)');\n    grad.addColorStop(0.3, 'rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.3)');\n    grad.addColorStop(0.7, 'rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.7)');\n    grad.addColorStop(1, 'rgba(5, 5, 8, 0.95)');\n    ctx.fillStyle = grad;\n\n    ctx.beginPath();\n    const points = 24;\n    for (let i = 0; i <= points; i++) {\n      const a = (i / points) * Math.PI * 2;\n      const wobble = r * (0.8 + 0.3 * Math.sin(a * 3 + radius * 0.01));\n      const px = cx + Math.cos(a) * wobble;\n      const py = cy + Math.sin(a) * wobble;\n      if (i === 0) ctx.moveTo(px, py);\n      else ctx.lineTo(px, py);\n    }\n    ctx.closePath();\n    ctx.fill();\n  }\n\n  private renderParticles(ctx: CanvasRenderingContext2D) {\n    this.particles.forEach((p) => {\n      ctx.save();\n      ctx.globalAlpha = p.alpha;\n      const colors: Record<string, string> = {\n        ink: '#1a1520',\n        mist: '#2a2520',\n        fog: '#1a1a20',\n        spark: '#c8a040',\n      };\n      ctx.fillStyle = colors[p.type] ?? '#1a1520';\n      ctx.beginPath();\n      const r = Math.max(0.5, p.radius);\n      if (p.type === 'spark') {\n        ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, r * 0.3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n      } else {\n        ctx.arc(p.x, p.y, r, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fill();\n      }\n      ctx.restore();\n    });\n  }\n}\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60e8bd2a-b118-4ebb-8072-7fe7ed523870","uuid":"358a3ac7-f15d-4a38-baac-29f7a396b172"}
